pceDa5TCkUCoUlUhL34FUl0msB8-s4CgN4v2p9d8j8NTo9fo8ndT8h_BRIHg9z9eY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPgJzCzN78J81EaTTy8Fq49K2voZ2W8njJAnd2kjMIwMA&oe=6AD3A9B6"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_44_20251202-131523.png", "id": "853472417082939", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822550_853472423749605_6621515077070126422_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aXJ8a1V0mCcQ7kNvwHXU0n6&_nc_oc=Ado3UEJwOhLpcI_83oL5MCoeqtg8EuXDRFTyDvr4CCziPXvHnCGL1XNAEBgiPsZuiPI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMc-PHV_76zIRs9_znTsHIDknOqWdfB28bqqrmTdeCN3A&oe=6AD388D2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1361199002222552", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821782_1361199005555885_917954452052319403_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QyMsxShj5uwQ7kNvwF5V9Zi&_nc_oc=AdozNnKwTHa7N7PFRp67jFPw9resnwoVa-vAVL9UqceJW99oC0O70etTa1_gyPcfNuI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNsPjCUBdE-7riQBfhpSv2BFqAn6qLnAOhyHJkTEFN9dg&oe=6AD3B210"}, "display_name": "Dig To Escape", "keywords": ["Prison", "Escape", "Dig", "Jail", "Fun"], "long_description": "# Dig to Escape\n\n**Grab your shovel and get digging!**  \n\nOutsmart sneaky moles, brawl with inmates, and take on wacky quests as you tunnel your way to freedom in the wildest prison break ever!\n\n**Dig for upgrades**\n\nCollect minerals and sell them to upgrade your tools. Better gear means bigger digs and more ways to escape.\n\n{2046789639497740}\n\n**Watch out for the mole**\n\nA sneaky thief is after your loot. Catch him before he makes off with your hard-earned minerals!\n\n{1547839482800416}\n\n**Be the inmate boss**\n\nBully, outsmart, or intimidate other inmates\n\n\n\n\n{1551401099280034}", "short_description": "Grab your shovel and get digging! Outsmart sneaky moles, brawl with Inmates, and take on wacky quests as you tunnel y